  {
    "id": 2009006030010,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ふんふん",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "特に……この日は夕方前と夜とで\r\n２つの撮影があるから、移動で忙しくなりそうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ふんふんふん……\r\nあれ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "この時間から撮影だと、\r\n学校終わってからで間に合うでしょうか……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、その日は学校の近くまで迎えにいくから大丈夫だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わかりました！　えっと……\r\n『プロデューサーさんがお迎えにきます』……っと",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030040"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0170",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "これでばっちりです！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "仕事のこと、ちゃんとメモしてて偉いな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ、ありがとうございますっ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "スケジュール帳ってなんだか大人みたいで……\r\n毎日使えるの、スッゴく楽しいです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "毎日しっかりチェックして、\r\n予定をちゃんと確認するんです！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど、果穂はしっかり者だな\r\n……その手帳、自分でカスタマイズできるやつか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！\r\nカレンダーとかノートとか、自分で選んで入れられるんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "スケジュールは白で、レッスンで教わったことはピンク\r\nお仕事であったことは黄緑のページです！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ちなみに、赤のページは読みにくかったですっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、確かに目がチカチカしそうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、そうやって内容ごとに紙の色を変えておくと\r\n後で探す時に便利だもんな",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい、スッゴく頼りになるスケジュール帳です！\r\nあたしのお仕事の、つよーい味方なんです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いい相棒じゃないか\r\nそれに、自分で見やすいようにして……偉いな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よかったら、見せてもらってもいいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030130,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！　どうぞ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どれどれ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0100",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0100",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030140,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ど、どうですか、プロデューサーさん……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……\r\nこのスケジュール帳……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "俺も見習わないとな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "シールが可愛いな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "いつから使ってるんだ？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030160,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えっ、プロデューサーさんがあたしを……ですか！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\nこのノート、しっかりと情報が整理されてるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "１ページ１ページ、\r\n果穂の仕事に対する想いが伝わってくるよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030170,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい……！\r\n想い、いっぱい詰まってます！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030180,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "予定を書く時、お仕事のことを考えて\r\nスッゴく楽しみになるんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030190,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "後から読み返すと、楽しかったお仕事のことを\r\n思い出して、も～っと楽しくなるんです！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\nそんな果穂の気持ちが、このノートからは溢れてるんだな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030200,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ、なんだか照れちゃいます……\r\nけど、スゴくうれしいです！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで、俺も果穂を見習って\r\nもっと仕事に対して真剣になろうって思ったんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030210,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんも……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030220,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……えへへ！\r\nあたしも、負けません！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030230,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だってあたし、アイドルのお仕事……\r\n大大、だーい好きですから！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030230"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030240,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わあっ！　プロデューサーさんもそう思いますか！？\r\nかわいいシールを貼ると、なんだか楽しくなるんです！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな\r\nそれで色んなシールが貼ってあるのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030250,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　あと、学校の友達とシールを\r\n交換したりするんです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030260,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "交換したシールは、この最後の……\r\nシールを貼って剥がせるページにとっとくんです！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、楽しそうだな\r\nん？　俺が果穂を学校へ迎えに行く日も貼ってあるな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030270,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "お気に入りのシールを大事なところに貼ると\r\n書いたことが覚えられるんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\nいろんな工夫がされた果穂流ノートってわけだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030280,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "果穂流……\r\nはい、果穂流、ですっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030290,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんも、\r\n果穂流に、これ、どうですか！？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　……柴犬のシールか\r\nもらっちゃっていいのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030300,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい、おすそわけです！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう\r\n果穂のおかげで、スケジュール管理がはかどりそうだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだ、せっかくだからこのシールは\r\n果穂の予定のところに貼ることにしよう",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030310,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ありがとうございます！\r\nえへへ、あたしの予定の、シール……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030320,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "それなら、プロデューサーさんのノート……\r\nあたしのシールでいっぱいにしちゃいますっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030320"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ここまで使いこなしてるってことは\r\n結構前からだよな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030330,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えっとですね\r\n最初に書いたのは……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030340,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "この日です！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900603/2009006030340"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これは──\r\n果穂が初めて事務所に来た日か",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006030350,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ。アイドルを始める時に、お母さんが\r\nお仕事用のノートを作ったら？　って言ってくれたんです",
